    "chunk_text": "De sancto Johanne.. Sanctus Johannes geseah ofer garsegc swilce hit land w\u00e6re. \u00dea genam hine se engel and gebrohte hine to Paradisum, \u00fe\u00e6t is, neorxnawonge. Paradisum nis na\u00f0or ne on heofonum ne on eor\u00fean. Feow\u00e6rtig f\u00e6dma heah w\u00e6s Noes flod ofer \u00f0a hehstan dune \u00fee on worulde is. Seo dun is on bocleden gehaten Armenia. Nu is Paradisum feow\u00e6rtig f\u00e6dma hehgra \u00feonne Noes flod w\u00e6s. Paradisus hanga\u00f0 betwynon heofonan and eor\u00f0an wundorlice, swa hit se ealw\u00e6ldend gesceop. Paradisus is eall efenlang and efenbrad. Nis \u00f0\u00e6r na\u00f0or ne d\u00e6l ne dune, ne \u00fe\u00e6r nebi\u00f0 snaw ne forst ne hagol ne ren, ac \u00fe\u00e6r is Fons Vite, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00d0onne Kalendas Januarii otun g\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feonne flow\u00e6\u00f0 seo welle swa f\u00e6gere and swa smoltlice swa hunig Hio flowe\u00f0 \u00e6lce mona\u00f0 ana si\u00f0e. \u00deonne se mona\u00fe in cyme\u00f0 Januarii and \u00fe\u00e6r is se f\u00e6gere wuduholt \u00fee is on bocum gehaten Radiansaltus. \u00de\u00e6r is \u00e6lc treow swa riht swa bolt and swa heah \u00fe\u00e6tte n\u00e6fre ne on eor\u00f0an nan man geseon meahte ne Nefeal\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6fre leaf of, ac a he bi\u00f0 singrene, wlitig and wynsum, welena unrim. Paradisus is uprihte on eastewearde \u00f0ysse worulde. Nis \u00fe\u00e6r ne mete ne hungor, ne \u00fe\u00e6r niht n\u00e6fre necyme\u00f0, ac a simble d\u00e6g. Sunne \u00fe\u00e6r scine\u00f0 seof",
